	(text "POWER CONTROL (always-on ATtiny): PA1/PA2 HIGH assert active-LOW ESP requests.\nESP GPIO14 HIGH asserts ACK_N LOW at ATtiny PA3. Pull GPIO14 LOW at boot.\nTiny: latch Q1 ON, request shutdown, wait for ACK_N or bounded timeout, then release Q1.\nESP: mute amplifiers / SDZ LOW, finish state writes, then assert ACK.\nFirmware changes required; transistor interfaces invert logic and prevent rail backfeed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 162.56 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "61662831-eb72-40b1-8fa8-366c26d101b3")
	)
	(text "J6: 1 = target VREF (BQ-SYS), 2 = UPDI, 3 = GND.\nUse a voltage-compatible programmer; do not back-power this rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 48.26 233.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d5b5b861-6a03-4508-a719-66faf1b899a7")
	)
